/* Export extra shapes; keystroke access */
"Fill the frame and follow the cursor" = "填满画面并跟随指针";
"The recording fills the whole frame (its sides are cropped) and the view moves with the cursor — for vertical or square video" = "录制填满整个画面（两侧会被裁剪），视图随指针移动——适用于竖屏或方形视频";
