"No keys were logged while recording. Daisyshot needs Accessibility access (System Settings › Privacy & Security › Accessibility) to see keystrokes — that's also how it finds typing to speed up." = "录制时没有记录到任何按键。Daisyshot 需要辅助功能权限（“系统设置” › “隐私与安全性” › “辅助功能”）才能看到按键，这也是查找可加速打字片段的方式。";
"No keystrokes were recorded, so typing can't be found and sped up. Allow Accessibility for Daisyshot before recording." = "没有录到按键，因此无法找到并加速打字。请在录制前为 Daisyshot 打开辅助功能权限。";

